    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6107765f-982a-5294-a679-9453b016808a" activityNameId="36ebc14d-e5fc-5ae0-91f3-42390f782417" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Beet chips, at fermentation plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Beet chips, at fermentation plant
The multioutput-process "sugar beets, to fermentation" delivers the co-products Ethanol, 95% in H20, from sugar beets",  "beets chips", and vinasse. The allocation is based on  economic criteria. World production of ethanol from sugar beets is around 10 Mio hl per year.;
UUID: 677ca5ae-9dd0-3b7c-aa39-8ee736cbfc26
Fermentation of sugar beets including materials, energy uses, infrastructure, and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled with data from a plant in Finland.
Technology: Production of ethanol from sugar beets with extraction, fermentation, and distillation of ethanol.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: The world production of ethanol from sugar beets is around 10 Mio hl per year.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Some data are derived from other or unknown plants or have been estimated.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_677ca5ae-9dd0-3b7c-aa39-8ee736cbfc26.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
